<title>USA: Aames commences 1.5 mln share offer.</title>
<headline>Aames commences 1.5 mln share offer.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aames Financial Corp said on Tuesday that it has begun an offering of 1.5 million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company also said it plans to issue $150 million of senior notes, due 2003. The equity offering is being underwritten by NatWest Securities Ltd, Bear Stearns &amp; Co, Oppenheimer &amp; Co and Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>Aames has granted the underwriters an option to purchase up to 225,000 additional shares for over-allotments.</p>
<p>Aames had about 15.8 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
</text>
